-- The foundation methods: every library module receives the `methods`
-- selections below implicitly, as a user module receives the prelude, except
-- the modules this one imports, which it is built from. The `_base` row only
-- makes the types visible here; library modules receive no names from it.
import:
    _base: Bool(), Option(), Result()
    bool: Bool methods
    option: Option methods
    result: Result methods
